  'State Forest Preserve, Debar Mountain Wild Forest (DEC). The trail is 1 mile and climbs 944 feet (DEC; Protect the Adirondacks gives 0.9 mile). The trailhead lot is on the west side of Blue Mountain Road, signed, and the trail starts on a dirt road at the back of it. Hours not given.',
